  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital Technologies in support of Agriculture Value chains and Rural Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the Ministry of Economy in deploying and operating the vineyard registry system (VRS) by developing capacities for the effective use of the VRS. , FAO will support the development of a mobile application to enhance farmers? access to digital services. The developed mobile application will be piloted within the vine makers? community in the rural areas; however it does not exclude the possibility to implement the software in other agricultural related sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
